{
  "id": 148452009,
  "iid": 6589,
  "project_id": 7898047,
  "title": "PROFINET: Support PROFIsafe 5 byte safety trailer",
  "description": "The PROFIsafe safety trailer was originally 4 bytes long (status/control byte + 3 bytes CRC). \nSince PROFIsafe 2.6, the safety trailer may be 5 bytes long (status/controlbyte + 4 bytes CRC). \nThe format is decided with the F-Parameter F_CRC_Seed. Currently, parsing a capture file with a 5 bytes trailer results in a shift in the IO data and IOPS/IOCS, leading to a wrong interpretation of the frame.\n\nThis MR calculates the safety IO data length based on F_CRC_Seed.",
  "state": "merged",
  "created_at": "2022-04-03T10:21:14.470Z",
